      "name": "Void Blizzard",
      "description": "Void Blizzard (LAUNDRY BEAR): new Russia-affiliated threat actor conducting espionage targeting NATO countries providing military or humanitarian aid to Ukraine. Uses stolen credentials from online marketplaces for initial access. In April 2025, began adversary-in-the-middle spear phishing targeting 20+ NGOs in Europe and US using typosquatted Microsoft Entra portal. Lures posed as European Defense and Security Summit invitations. Compromised organizations overlap with targets of Forest Blizzard, Midnight Blizzard, and Secret Blizzard.",
      "aliases": [
        "LAUNDRY BEAR"
      ],
      "x_cti_metadata": {
        "kind": "threat_actor_campaign",
        "source": "Microsoft Threat Intelligence blog May 2025",
        "vendor": "Microsoft",
